WEBVTT

39:35.948 --> 39:37.824
Sheriff, I can see
your dwelling from here.

39:37.908 --> 39:40.035
-You're almost home.
-Nirvana is coming.

39:40.119 --> 39:42.704
-The mystic portal awaits.
-Will you be quiet?

39:42.788 --> 39:44.247
You guys don't get it, do you?

39:44.331 --> 39:47.625
Once we go into Sid's house,
we won't be coming out.

39:48.169 --> 39:50.170
Whoa, Scud! Hey, boy!

39:50.254 --> 39:52.297
Sit! Good boy.

39:52.381 --> 39:55.175
-Hey, I got something for you, boy.
-Freeze!

39:57.678 --> 39:59.846
Ready, set, now!
